  "steps": [
    "Boil the spaghetti according to the package instructions. Reserve the pasta water and drain the spaghetti.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a pan over medium heat. Add the sliced onions and cook until lightly browned.",
    "Add a splash of water and continue cooking. Repeat this process 2–3 times until the onions become deeply caramelized.",
    "Add the garlic and mushrooms. Cook for 1–2 minutes, then pour in a splash of the reserved pasta water and let the mushrooms cook until tender.",
    "Season with chilli oil, salt, black pepper, and zero-calorie sweetener.",
    "Blend the low-fat paneer with water until completely smooth. Pour the paneer sauce into the pan with the flame at lowest and mix well.",
    "Add the cooked spaghetti and toss until everything is evenly coated. Add more reserved pasta water if needed to adjust the consistency.",
    "Finish with cheese, garnish with fresh basil leaves, and serve hot."
